# Keep committed text files LF on every platform.
# `wiki fmt` writes CRLF in a Windows working tree regardless of
# `wiki.yml`'s `fmt.end_of_line` (that option is currently inert), so git
# normalization here is what keeps CRLF out of the repository: without it, a
# Windows `wiki fmt` run would commit whole-file line-ending churn.
* text=auto eol=lf
